{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港仔發現浮屍。今日（27日）下午3時許，警方接獲途人報案，發現一名男子在瀑布灣道一個石灘岸邊漂浮，救護員接報到場，證實事主當場死亡，事主死因有待驗屍後確定，案件列作「屍體發現」處理。</p><p>據了解，事主為80歲梁姓老翁。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:00:47.425931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T18:18:27.846777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:32.919819+00:00","content_hash":"59564b28ce3c97b1e5600a9cdd81710ab1ac19e9f4bb3b2bf0e13b8aa16e0071","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}